            "review_text": "Kiet Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nNha Trang chicken rice\nApr 2024 • Family\nThe chicken rice restaurant is mainly eaten by locals. It is located at the corner of Au Co street and Le Hong Phong street. The owner is enthusiastic and friendly. The restaurant is small, so if you go in large numbers, consider it.\nOur chicken has sweet, chewy meat, delicious flavor, and a rich yellow sauce that is a characteristic feature.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 21, 2024",
